<https://loze-ontology.org/hasNumberOfOccurrences> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> <https://loze-ontology.org/materials-and-composition> .
