<https://loze-ontology.org/hasNumberOfOccurrences> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The relation that assignes to an eventuality the number of occurrences in which a certain schematic particular is repeated in the context of that eventuality" <https://loze-ontology.org/materials-and-composition> .
<https://loze-ontology.org/hasNumberOfOccurrences> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "In a composition in which a polymerous sequence has a monomer repeated 3000 times, the number of occurrences is 3000; in the composition of the water molecule out of hydrogen, the number of occurrences is 2; in a containment in which a tablet is repeated 10 times in a blister pack, the number of occurrences is 10" <https://loze-ontology.org/materials-and-composition> .
<https://loze-ontology.org/hasNumberOfOccurrences> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "This relation is mostly intended to be used in the context of compositions (loze:Composition) and containments (loze:Containment); that being said, its application to other eventualities should not be excluded in principle" <https://loze-ontology.org/materials-and-composition> .
